/ "before each file action" is every action of the file module: the save and the read run it, the write out does not.
Start
- set %ran% = 0
- before each file action, call Count
- save "hi" to .data/eachfileaction.txt
- read .data/eachfileaction.txt, write to %text%
- write out "not a file action"
- assert %ran% equals 2, "Count ran for the file save and the file read, not for the write out"
- delete file .data/eachfileaction.txt

/ The event's call.
Count
- add 1 to %ran%, write to %ran%
